{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act49side_level_act49side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act49side",
  "stageId": "act49side_02",
  "title": "大头鬼",
  "storyCode": "TA-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2e42eca84558b5f554fa58687ec2f74133d2c5632d427b17d27e6ae19af1f346",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "70_g7_suilingcore"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......呵。\n你还在用傲慢遮掩你的恐惧。\n何必徒劳？\n愤怒，害怕，期待......你想在我身上看见的东西，我在你身上一览无遗。\n如果你不害怕，那便入局。\n这一次......\n输的一定会是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "70_g11_oldpavilion"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一局，是我输了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>593年</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没想到这边对杀还有这一种变化......真是失算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......百手左右，要不是你在腹地一味退让求和，说不定还有争胜可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此......那时算不清后续变化，就只能选了最稳妥的下法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我还以为最近在棋艺上有些长进，看来还是差你许多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近这一战，多亏你以逸待劳、诱敌深入的计策，我军才得以避免许多伤亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这次回京可以好好歇息一阵，只是下次再见，恐怕又得是许久之后了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒是一点都没有把胜负放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟相处，又不是庙算胜负，何必这么计较。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不光是下棋，我看你不管在哪都乐意做宅心仁厚的老好人，什么事都可以不放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这又是从何说起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "两月前，新上任的兵部右侍郎连同礼部共参了你一本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拥兵独断，不是小罪名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "近半年来你我一直同在前线，你如何能得知朝中的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我自有办法，你应该担心的是你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他说的是之前我带兵不曾按时回营的事，那是因为行军途中突遇天灾，不得不另外扎营。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这件事杨将军当时便已经知晓，就算兵部追责起来，也当有公论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒不是让你担心这一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位侍郎被查出收受贿赂，手伸到了军需用度上......此时应该正在狱中候审。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暂时不会再由着他谣言惑众，至于能不能活着从狱里出来，就要看他的运气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你答应过我，不会再染指朝堂政事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明是帮大炎除去了一个不干净的官员，怎么还反过来指责我多管闲事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你很清楚自己到底是什么用心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是觉得整个朝堂都是你的棋局，别人的性命都是你的掌上玩物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵，你愿意当正人君子，难道你就看不到有多少人用心险恶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那人刚上任就敢将矛头指向你，难道背后没有他人指使？想要与我们为敌的岂止一人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对这一人手软，后患无穷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从幺弟诞生以来，我们周遭发生了多少怪事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......方的病人明明见好，却莫名其妙地投了井。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人模仿夕的笔触，借她的名头画了不少颠倒黑白的“讽喻之作”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "易的园子进了盗匪，丢失了几件重要的藏物。大理寺严加审问，到最后发现只是一伙不折不扣的笨贼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后，就是关于你的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都清楚......祂还未死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里的人们从未忘记祂是何等恐怖之物，直到现在，我们的一举一动，每一次见面，都要被严加监管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道你还认为，靠你立下的一星半点的功绩，就可以让人不把我们当作其心可诛的异类？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "方弟和夕妹......都还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "方的确消沉了一阵子，夕从来都是如此，不过想必他们都不至于太放在心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "问题在于，今后又该如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你认为，这一切背后都有人在操纵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是山海众，还是其他人别有用心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这才是我担心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果这些事背后都有一个统一的指使者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我算不到此人会是谁，更不知道他意图如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说的这些事，我会找司岁台一一核实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道你是好心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次别再行这种逾矩之事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们之间何曾是彼此担忧的关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是不想遭人陷害还一无所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "时候差不多了，该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "路途遥远，路上多加小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回京后，代我问候他们吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我未必会去见他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "朔",
      "speakerId": "avg_2024_chyue_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "代理人于是辞别手足同胞，向京城的方向走去。\n路途遥远，他走得很急，没时间为了路上听见的一丝杂音驻足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一招不慎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "满盘皆输......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那，我们就从余开始，怎么样？\n好啊。余......我想想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "余音绕梁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "70_g12_oldyanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁、梁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三姐，梁......梁字能接什么成语啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该不会刚一开始就要认输了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么会，我就是忙着处理兽肉，没工夫想。再给我点时间嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，好......我还有不少书要抄，你慢慢想，不着急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁......感觉应该去抓四哥问问，但是四哥又不在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "横梁、房梁、栋梁——栋梁之材！\n不对，梁字应该在第一个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（对了，三姐手边有那么多写字的竹简，偷偷看一眼，没准......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小余？怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——没事没事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，三姐。你为什么要把这些竹简上的字，全部抄到这些方片上呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是最近人们的新发明，叫“纸”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，它比竹简轻便，写起字来更容易，还不会轻易生虫腐化，更方便保存呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "写在“纸”上的东西，就能永远保存下来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，也不全是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "写在竹简上的东西或许可以完整留存几十年，写在纸上的文字，也许能保存数百年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但竹简也好纸张也罢，总还是会有腐化的一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论用什么东西去记载，只有记下来的东西，真正被人们记住了，那才能永远地留存下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像小余做的菜一样，人们尝过了，也会永远记住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男孩似懂非懂地听着，坐在刚处理好的整只牧兽旁边抓耳挠腮，怎么也想不出那个“梁”开头的成语。\n一枚从竹简上削下来，带着一小段话的薄片忽然落在他面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梁上君子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不错不错，“梁上君子”。让我想想，子字该接的是......子虚——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不玩啦，还是等下次大姐和夕姐在的时候我看你们玩吧。这个“接龙”的游戏好难啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "三姐，你饿不饿？要不要我把兽肉做了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些竹简要是不用了，能不能也给我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要拿来生火吗？可以是可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年幼的代理人从姐姐手里接过竹简，熟练地从中间剖开......\n削成一根一根的竹签。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是要做......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烤肉串！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这头牧兽的里脊肥瘦正好，肚子上的膘也挺厚实，拿来做烤肉肯定好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于烧火的材料，还得是木炭。这些竹简烧不久的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "木炭我早就备好了，等竹签削好，肉串串完，就可以开始烤肉啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......这是不是也算人们说的“吃墨水”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，那这道菜就叫，“墨水烤肉”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小余的手艺总不会错，我就等着大饱口福啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，正好这些竹简也抄好了，你都拿去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们都在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......你回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二......二哥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前收到了信，我还以为你要过几天才能到呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "路上还顺利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只听说过有人焚琴煮羽，已经是糟蹋败坏至极。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是在拿书简做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......三姐给我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "70_g12_oldyanroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看到从屋外走进来的男人，男孩怯生生地躲在姐姐的身后，只露出半个脑袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一些坏了的竹简，就交给小余物尽其用了。你凶什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小余好心准备晚饭，你还不领情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也没说什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二哥三姐......！你们别吵架！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我先去准备晚饭！二哥回来一趟不容易，今天我们终于能一起吃晚饭啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "余",
      "speakerId": "avg_2026_yu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你们先聊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他本来就有些怯你，你就不能稍微温柔一点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事情不顺利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过我们一家人难得能聚一次，小余也总惦记着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什么事，等先吃完饭再说，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来在我不知道的地方，还发生了这么多令人不安的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看上去倒一点也不担忧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然还是会担忧的，我只是有些惊讶......原来二哥也会这样关心我们兄弟姐妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是诞生于同一个破碎的意识，与所谓的血亲哪有半分相似。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各自志趣有别，生死无关，到底是......道不相同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二哥当真是这样想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的想法倒是不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，我们来到这世上已有数百年，就算无法完全融入其中，所见的那些风景人物，大多是可爱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是每每遇到可以交谈相识的人，仿佛只是须臾一瞬，就已经变成过往云烟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到最后，留在身边的，还能说些真心话的人，还是只有“我们”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算有些矛盾，性格脾气有不合的地方，但无论如何也无法割舍......这样的关系，难道不是像极了人世间的兄弟姐妹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你愿意这样想，我也无意辩驳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......真不知道你为什么总是这副拒人千里之外的样子。我们好不容易能见一次面，难道一点都不开心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是哪一天，哪个弟弟妹妹突然消失，你再也见不到了，我倒要看看你会不会后悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，二哥既然说到这些事，不久前，我也遇上了一件怪事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一天夜里，我正准备睡觉，突然听见书房里有响动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在院中，隔着窗户仿佛看到一个人影正伏在案上，似乎在写些什么东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我连忙赶了进去，没看到什么人，只看到了几天前我誊抄的那本《急就章》摊开放在书桌上。不知道被什么人涂画成了这个样子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "颉说着，从书桌上找出了那本书帖。\n书上每个笔迹工整的文字上，都覆写上了同一个字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二哥......你觉得这究竟会是何人所为？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只可能是祂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祂在苏醒，祂正在通过某种方式干涉我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在余降世后，我们原本都以为祂的神识应当已经被消磨殆尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可祂还活着......祂现在还在沉睡，却成了我们每个人的梦魇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有朝一日祂醒来，那我们则会变成祂浮光泡影的梦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关于此事，二哥有什么主意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我暂时还不知道，但我会想办法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那要不要听一听，我的主意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实我也是直到最近才想到......起因是我发现，我和炎国的人们一同编撰史书的时候，无论多么小心，总还是会有犯错的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不同于寻常文章，写在史书上的错，想要去删改修正，可要花费不少功夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "说着，颉拿起书桌上一柄用于削竹简的书刀，又随手拾起一卷书，用书刀在纸上轻轻一刮。\n深深沁入纸张，甚至有少许洇在了下一页上的墨迹，随着书刀和纸页的接触消逝无踪，纸面重新变得光洁如新。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这书刀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概是沾染了一些我的气息，变得有些不寻常了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我隐隐有种感觉，它刮去的文字——一段历史，或者，也许至少......一个名字——不仅会消失在纸上，也会从人们心中被抹除。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在想，或许终有一天，我们可以用它，从世上的所有文字中，抹去“岁”这个字呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能够做到......这种事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在还不能。现在它只是一把有点神奇之处的书刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我能感觉得到，记述的文字越多，我手中的刀和笔，便越有分量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许我们都一样，我们从那片混沌鸿蒙中找到了“我是谁”的答案，又在这人世间明确了自己存在的意义，这正是我们有别于祂的证明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许有朝一日，我们拥有的力量会超越祂，到那时，我们就能够摆脱祂的影响，真正作为“我们”而活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然前提是，我们绝对不可以忘了自己是谁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二哥？你又在一个人想什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......不必在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......有时候我在想，或许兄弟姐妹当中，我和你的脾气应该是最不对付的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算计筹谋，都是要藏在心里的东西，但是文字语言，却是要把心中所想传达出来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但有时候我又偏偏觉得，你对我明明毫无隐瞒。你心里想的，我都能看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想来也真有趣，我们各自在这世上找到了一样尽心钻研的事物，结果像是反过来被改变了个性一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黍常常说我总是沉湎过去，我也记得她说过的，在未来尽头看到的那一片雪白的死寂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她说得也没错，心里有放不下的事，到底是没办法强装豁达的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，二哥始终在担忧那个不可知的将来......你最在意胜负，可若只有胜负，这活法未免也太干瘪枯瘦了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二哥，在胜负之外，你牵挂的到底是什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "并非牵挂胜负，只是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是对必败的棋局，心有不甘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，你明天不是要回司岁台述职？那我抄好的这些书，就麻烦二哥帮我顺路送去了。进天镜阁前，这些书他们还要再过一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，那卷重新抄过的《急就章》，麻烦二哥上交之前再帮我仔细看看吧。书刀也给你，免得有错字不好改。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "speakerId": "avg_2027_wang_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你经手的文章，哪里用得到我来核查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就当是你最近闲时的消遣，随便看看嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二哥常年为战事筹谋，心里都被胜负得失占满了。不如做点别的事，换换心情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "颉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2125_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，说不定能在文章里发现你在找的东西呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
